WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.010
- My brother was a disk jockey

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.350
and he built his own radio station.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.960
And he would play all
these incredible albums

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.860
from the late '60s.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.322
And of course he played
the "Let it Be" album.

00:00:12.322 --> 00:00:13.155
- Yeah.

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:16.070
And he played "Across the Universe,"

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.920
and I must have been four years old.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.300
And I remember being frozen, paralyzed,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.295
listening to that music.

00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:24.332
♪ Pools of sorrow, waves of joy ♪

00:00:24.332 --> 00:00:27.841
And it just, it's my
favorite song ever written.

00:00:27.841 --> 00:00:28.780
- It's so beautiful.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.870
- Which is why I'm gonna announce

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.425
some big news for everybody.

00:00:31.425 --> 00:00:32.864
- Wait, what?

00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:34.892
- I'm gonna have a little girl.

00:00:34.892 --> 00:00:35.873
- I know that.

00:00:35.873 --> 00:00:37.857
I know that! Oh!
(audience cheering)

00:00:37.857 --> 00:00:38.764
I knew you were having a baby,

00:00:38.764 --> 00:00:40.621
I didn't know it was a girl!
- Yeah.

00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:44.360
And her name, because of
"Across the Universe,"

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.890
her name is gonna be Lennon, Lennon Augie.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.110
Augie after my father.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.319
And I'll call her Lenny
for short, but yeah.

00:00:51.319 --> 00:00:52.929
- I love that.
- Thank you.

00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:54.785
Thank you.
(audience cheering)

00:00:54.785 --> 00:00:56.394
- That's so exciting.

00:00:56.394 --> 00:00:57.227
- Yeah, I'm thrilled.

00:00:57.227 --> 00:00:59.060
- You're gonna be a girl dad.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:01.260
- It's gonna be the biggest
adventure of my life.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.567
So here we go.
- [Kelly] I love that.

